<title>USA: Simione sets 1-for-2 reverse stk split.</title>
<headline>Simione sets 1-for-2 reverse stk split.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simione Central Holdings Inc said Tuesday that it has adopted a one-for-two reverse stock split, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Simione Central provides integrated systems  and services for the home health care industry.</p>
